3. Bubble Sort

Algorithm: 

BubbleSort(arr, n)
Step 1: Start
Step 2: Repeat for i = 0 to n - 2:
2.1: swapped = false
2.2: Repeat for j = 0 to n - i - 2:
2.2.1: If arr[j] > arr[j + 1], swap them and set swapped = true
2.3: If swapped == false, break (array sorted hai)
Step 3: Exit / Stop

Time Complexities:

Best Case: O(n) 
Average Case: O(n^2)
Worst Case: O(n^2)
